# LJSpeech layout expected by src/preprocess_ljspeech.py
#
#   MyTTSDataset/metadata.csv   pipe-separated, NO header row
#   MyTTSDataset/wavs/<id>.wav  one file per row
#
# Columns:  id | raw-text | normalized-text
#
# The loader reads it with header=None and quoting=QUOTE_NONE, so the text must
# contain no pipe and no quote handling. Column 3 is what actually reaches the
# tokenizer; column 2 is kept for inspection.
#
# Generate it with:  python tools/build_dataset.py
#
# Example rows (the real file has no '#' comments):
mana_00000|وقتی یک فرد با دوربین دوچشمی|وقتی یک فرد با دوربین دوچشمی.
narr_FA_BZTRSRBSH_part002|قیمت ۲۵۰۰ تومان است|قیمت دو هزار و پانصد تومان است.
